Hi gang,

I've been feeling nostalgic lately, and dusted off a multia to play 
around with.  NetBSD 5.0-beta (circa January 16th) is working just fine, 
with the exception that I can't seem to get a PCI USB 2.0 controller to 
work in the box.

With either an NEC or VIA chipset card (the two I have laying around), I 
get:

